config AW8624_HAPTIC
	tristate "Awinic AW8624 haptic driver"
	depends on I2C
	select ANDROID_TIMED_OUTPUT
	select NEW_LEDS
	select LEDS_CLASS
	help
	  Say Y here if you have Awinic AW8624 haptic controller
	  chip in your system.

	  The driver registers the haptic as

	    * an Android timed_output device
	      (/sys/class/timed_output/vibrator/enable),

	    * the LED "vibrator" class device the Android vibrator HAL
	      drives (/sys/class/leds/vibrator/{duration,activate,state}),

	    * and a force-feedback input device (FF_RUMBLE/FF_PERIODIC).

	  If unsure, say N.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called aw8624.
